[
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "at": [
      "170.18",
      "31.75",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "2. CURRENT INPUTS - SLOW TREND CANDIDATE"
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "at": [
      "12.7",
      "113.03",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "CN7: 16=3V3, 20=GND\n35=PC2, 37=PC3\n36=PC1/PB9*, 38=PC0/PB8*\n* Verify solder bridges; preserve IMU PB8/PB9.\nCN10 pins intentionally unused by this shield.\nNC marks do not alter the NUCLEO wiring."
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "at": [
      "12.7",
      "162.56",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "4. TEST POINTS"
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "at": [
      "205.74",
      "142.24",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "12k + 100nF: nominal fc=132.6 Hz\n100nF is AFTER resistor, not directly on VIOUT."
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "at": [
      "294.64",
      "31.75",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "3. NTC INPUTS - 103JT-025 OFF-BOARD"
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "at": [
      "213.36",
      "210.82",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "OPEN MECHANICAL ITEMS\n- Connector models and resistor/capacitor body envelopes are provisional.\n- Template header positions only; actual socket height / clearance not verified.\n- Keep RESET / USER / jumpers / ST-LINK access and cable strain relief.\n- A clean ERC is not proof of these electrical or mechanical conditions."
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "at": [
      "12.7",
      "31.75",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "1. NUCLEO-F446RE MORPHO INTERFACE"
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "at": [
      "12.7",
      "17.78",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "DRAFT - NOT FOR FABRICATION OR CONNECTION\nSignal circuits only; current-sensor power path remains off-board."
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "at": [
      "12.7",
      "12.7",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "TMR MONITOR SHIELD | RevA.0 DESIGN STARTER"
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "at": [
      "205.74",
      "86.36",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "12k + 100nF: nominal fc=132.6 Hz\n100nF is AFTER resistor, not directly on VIOUT."
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "at": [
      "12.7",
      "210.82",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "OPEN ELECTRICAL ITEMS\n- Input ESD / fault protection and unpowered backfeed not designed yet.\n- 3V3 supply margin, carrier decoupling and cable capacitance to be checked.\n- ADC acquisition/leakage budget and sensor disconnection handling remain open.\n- No automatic motor stop threshold is defined by this sheet."
  },
